PETSELFTEST1
# Board on the atomic ledger: one feed commits to kid_pet_sync, the sleep
# flow powers off through the PMIC with the RTC alarm armed, the board
# boots again and the ledger restores exactly what it held at power-off:
# the same generation (ledger_gen= / gen=) and the same feed count (fed=).
# The first boot of this firmware migrates the old kid_pet / kid_parent
# keys (before "mark begin"); the boot after the alarm finds the marker.
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect commits 1
# expect ledger_restored 1
# expect min:migration=already 1
# expect none:migration=failed 0
# expect min:PET_SLEEP_SHOWN 1
# expect min:settled=1 1
# expect min:alarm_s=45 1
# expect min:armed=1 1
# expect min:wake=selftest 1
# expect min:woke_by_alarm=1 1
# expect min:reason=alarm_wake 1
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_POWEROFF_RETURNED 0
# expect none:PET_INPUT_REJECTED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
wait 20000
pet
wait 7000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral" (selection back on Story).
tap press 7000
hold press 1500 7000
mark begin
# Rail: Story(1) -> Feed(3), press: one durable feed (happy face, hearts).
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap press 8000
# PWR: sleep, power off, RTC alarm wakes the board 45 s later.
alarm 45
tap pwr 30000
end
